DISCLAIMER AND TERMS OF USE

This software ("GhostConnect") is provided for educational, privacy protection,
and authorized security research purposes only.

AUTHORIZED USE CASES:
- Personal privacy protection
- Authorized security research and testing
- Penetration testing with proper authorization
- Educational and training purposes
- Defensive security operations
- CTF (Capture The Flag) competitions
- Security tool development and testing

PROHIBITED USE:
- Any illegal activities
- Unauthorized access to computer systems
- Malicious purposes or intent to harm
- Evasion of law enforcement
- Violation of local, state, or federal laws
- Violation of terms of service of third-party systems
- Any activity that causes harm to others

